        "body": "What practical answer would you give to the company about whether the weight of the boxes have changed from 20 oz.? Box weights more than 0.001 oz. (0.03 gram) different from the stated weight will cause a problem for the company. The appropriate value from the confidence interval or bound is 19.99 oz. The sample mean is 19.96 oz. and the sample standard deviation is 0.0901 oz.",
